# SDR Type 01h - Full Sensor Record, threshold sensor with an analog reading.
#
# Record ID 1234h and sensor number 11h are deliberately *not* small round
# numbers: the record ID's two bytes differ, so a big-endian read of it shows
# up in the Get SDR request bytes, and the sensor number differs from every
# other sensor in sensor.tr so a reading fetched for the wrong sensor is
# visible.  See the "distinct, non-zero bytes" rule in tests/transport/Bmc.zig.

34 12        # [1:2]  Record ID = 0x1234
51           # [3]    SDR version 1.5 (51h)
01           # [4]    Record type 01h = Full Sensor Record
30           # [5]    Record length = 48 bytes follow

20           # [6]    Sensor owner ID (BMC, slave address 20h)
00           # [7]    Owner LUN 0, channel 0
11           # [8]    Sensor number 11h
03           # [9]    Entity ID 3 = Processor
02           # [10]   Entity instance 2
7f           # [11]   Sensor initialization
68           # [12]   Sensor capabilities: thresholds readable+settable
01           # [13]   Sensor type 01h = Temperature
01           # [14]   Event/reading type 01h = threshold
ff 3f        # [15:16] Assertion event mask / lower threshold reading mask
ff 3f        # [17:18] Deassertion event mask / upper threshold reading mask
3f 3f        # [19:20] Settable / readable threshold mask (all six thresholds)
00           # [21]   Units 1: analog format 0 (unsigned), no rate/modifier/pct
01           # [22]   Units 2: base unit 01h = degrees C
00           # [23]   Units 3: no modifier unit
00           # [24]   Linearization: linear
02           # [25]   M = 2 (LS 8 bits)
03           # [26]   M MS 2 bits = 0, tolerance = 3
00           # [27]   B = 0 (LS 8 bits)
00           # [28]   B MS 2 bits | accuracy LS 6 bits
00           # [29]   Accuracy MS | accuracy exp | sensor direction
00           # [30]   R exponent | B exponent (both 0)
07           # [31]   Analog flags: nominal, normal max and normal min specified
28           # [32]   Nominal reading = 40
50           # [33]   Normal maximum = 80
0a           # [34]   Normal minimum = 10
ff           # [35]   Sensor maximum reading = 255
00           # [36]   Sensor minimum reading = 0
5f           # [37]   Upper non-recoverable = 95
55           # [38]   Upper critical = 85
4b           # [39]   Upper non-critical = 75
05           # [40]   Lower non-recoverable = 5
0a           # [41]   Lower critical = 10
0f           # [42]   Lower non-critical = 15
04           # [43]   Positive-going threshold hysteresis
06           # [44]   Negative-going threshold hysteresis (differs from positive)
00 00        # [45:46] Reserved
00           # [47]   OEM
c5           # [48]   ID string type/length: 8-bit ASCII, 5 characters
54 65 6d 70 41   # [49:53] "TempA"
